---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | PSFF Season 03">
  <article
    class="w-full border-b border-zinc-900 py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 selection:bg-[#D9381E] selection:text-[#F6F4EE]"
  >
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12 sm:space-y-16">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="space-y-4 border-b border-zinc-300 pb-8">
        <div
          class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#D9381E] transition-colors"
            >&larr; Home</a
          >
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Legal</span>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Privacy Policy</span>
        </div>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[#161616] leading-none"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>

        <p
          class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#D9381E] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
        >
          Pazhassi Short Film Festival &bull; Season 03 (2026)
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div
        class="space-y-10 font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-800 leading-relaxed sm:leading-loose"
      >
        <p
          class="first-letter:text-6xl first-letter:font-black first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-4 first-letter:leading-none first-letter:text-[#161616]"
        >
          This Privacy Policy outlines how the <strong
            >Pazhassi Short Film Festival (PSFF)</strong
          >, organized jointly by <strong>Drishtidosham Chalachithravedi</strong
          > and <strong>Pazhassi Raja Smaraka Granthalayam</strong>, collects,
          handles, and protects personal information and submitted creative
          materials across our registration portal and evaluation systems.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            1. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            When submitting a film or interacting with our portal, we collect
            only necessary operational details:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-700"
          >
            <li>
              <strong>Filmmaker &amp; Crew Details:</strong> Full name, email address,
              contact phone number, postal address, and production credentials of
              the director and producer.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Film Metadata:</strong> Title, synopsis, runtime, genre, language,
              country of production, and promotional stills or official poster artwork.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Screener Information:</strong> Streaming video links (e.g.,
              private Vimeo, YouTube unlisted, or Google Drive) and access passwords
              provided for evaluation purposes.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Payment Verification:</strong> Transaction reference numbers
              (UTR/Transaction ID) and uploaded payment receipts for registration
              fee verification.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            2. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            Collected data is strictly used for festival operations:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-700"
          >
            <li>
              Processing entry registrations, confirming fee verification, and
              issuing official entry numbers.
            </li>
            <li>
              Enabling secure screening access for jury members to assess and
              score competition films.
            </li>
            <li>
              Communicating selection status, scheduling, award announcements,
              and festival notifications.
            </li>
            <li>
              Publishing official festival catalogs, schedules, and promotional
              materials for accepted films (titles, director credits, and
              posters only).
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            3. Protection of Screener Links &amp; Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            We treat all submitted screener links, video files, and unreleased
            creative works with strict confidentiality:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-700"
          >
            <li>
              Private screener URLs and passwords are accessible solely to the
              authorized festival convenor and verified jury members via
              encrypted, password-protected portals.
            </li>
            <li>
              We do not share, distribute, publicize, or broadcast screener
              links to third parties or general audiences.
            </li>
            <li>
              All intellectual property rights and copyrights remain entirely
              with the respective filmmakers and rights holders.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            4. Data Retention &amp; Security
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            Your personal information is securely stored in authenticated
            databases with role-based security policies. We do not sell, rent,
            or commercialize filmmaker contact information or participant
            records to any external advertising networks or commercial entities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            5. Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, wish to
            update your contact details, or request deletion of your entry data
            after festival conclusion, please contact the festival directorate
            at <a
              href="mailto:convener@psff.in"
              class="text-[#D9381E] font-bold underline underline-offset-4"
              >convener@psff.in</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Note -->
      <footer
        class="border-t border-zinc-300 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600"
      >
        <span>Pazhassi Short Film Festival &bull; Mananthavady, Wayanad</span>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="font-bold text-[#161616] hover:text-[#D9381E] underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          &larr; Back to Festival Portal
        </a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
